ek into that went in  they came and arrested me  and threw me in a military prison with  no charges  no explanation why i was being thrown in  prison they just said they had orders  from uh  admiral greene who was the uh  the admiral in charge of uh war com at  the time and then also signed off by uh  commander rosenblum who was the  commodore of group one for naval special  warfare  um  any do you know any reason why they  arrested you on 9 11.  uh yeah 11 2018 what was the reason  behind that was that like a message i  mean you know you could do 9 12 9 10 9  11 is 9 11.  exactly everything they do and this is  what i learned through this process so  all these actions they took against me  are done on purpose  them raiding my house without myself my  wife there was to enrage me and also to  break up my family and also to put shame  on our family which worked because our  neighbors  were like oh they just don't do that to  people unless you did something  and then uh during uh  when i was at the tvi clinic they chose  september 11th for that specific reason  because they know that day means a lot  to us who have been serving the past 20  years and they thought that would make  me snap and i would do something  obviously i'm a lot smarter than that i  just i complied i thought i was like  this is a big mistake  and i thought that you know in my mind i  was like this is a big mistake you guys  uh this will be fixed but as i came to  find out once you're thrown in military  prison  even as a pre-trial prisoner um you are  not getting out at all until your trial  date and  once they throw you in there they just  keep pushing your trial date back and  back and back hoping you'll take a plea  deal so you know  the video that you say that they sent to  ncis and for audience that doesn't know  what ncis is ncis is uh  it's the intelligence organization right  it's it's uh the what does nci stand for  naval criminal investigative service  yeah naval criminal investigation okay  so once it goes there there was one  video that was circulating what was that  one video with the body that was limp  and you apologize for that one video i  don't know what they had john was that  on 60 minutes there was somewhere i saw  a video with you  so body  there's pictures so what they did when  they raided my house uh they had they  took  they took all my phones everything um  and uh there was a picture  of me posing with a dead isis fighter uh  along with uh 12 other people in my  pretend  and also i had sent a text message uh  to a buddy of mine  during that deployment as a joke um with  that picture saying good story behind  this got him with a honey knife  that was a  dark humor um i but i'll tell you what  that that was the best and worst piece  of evidence they had against me um  you know it was the worst because  obviously it makes me look  pretty guilty uh but if you you know  zoom in on the picture and look there's  no blood on the knife there's no blood  on me there's no blood anywhere no no uh  uh  nothing that shows this guy's been  stabbed uh  but they took that text message and that  picture and that's that was their main  piece of evidence they're like we got  him and that's they were going around  telling everybody they had me dead to  rights like he's guilty  he's going away  but they had also since these um younger  guys in my platoon had said there was a  video  they were you know they were spreading  that rumor as well saying like because  they the judge had put a gag order on  all the evidence so you we weren't  allowed to show the evidence to anybody  and neither was the prosecution or they  they weren't supposed to but as we come  came to find out they were given  whatever evidence they wanted to the  media um to sort of smear my name  but uh  eventually we got the judge uh to let us  show the video to congress um because  that lie had gone all the way up to the  white house saying there was a video of  me doing uh this act and so once we were  able to show the actual video to members  of congress and whoever else it was they  quickly realized that they had been lied  to by the navy  and that's where you know their case  started crumbling so if you like this  sort of short club from an interview i  did click over here to watch the entire  interview and  please don't forget to subscribe to the  channel take care everybody bye  [Music]  you
 

